otboll\" title=\"Svenska mästare i fotboll\">SM</a>-titeln)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Nedflyttade</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken\" title=\"BK Häcken\">BK Häcken</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rgryte_IS\" title=\"Örgryte IS\">Örgryte IS</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Östers IF</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uefa_Champions_League_2007/2008\" title=\"Uefa Champions League 2007/2008\">Champions League</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Elfsborg\" title=\"IF Elfsborg\">IF Elfsborg</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uefacupen_2007/2008\" title=\"Uefacupen 2007/2008\">Uefacupen</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Helsingborgs_IF\" title=\"Helsingborgs IF\">Helsingborgs IF</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken\" title=\"BK Häcken\">BK Häcken</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intertotocupen_2007\" title=\"Intertotocupen 2007\">Intertotocupen</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Hammarby IF Fotboll\">Hammarby IF</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Royal_League_2006/2007\" title=\"Royal League 2006/2007\">Royal League</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Elfsborg\" title=\"IF Elfsborg\">IF Elfsborg</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Hammarby IF Fotboll\">Hammarby IF</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Helsingborgs_IF\" title=\"Helsingborgs IF\">Helsingborgs IF</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;background-color:#f0f1f2;\">Statistik</th></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Totalt&#160;antal&#160;mål</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">467 (2,58 per match)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Bästa målgörare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">15 mål:<br /><a href=\"/wiki/Ari_da_Silva_Ferreira\" title=\"Ari da Silva Ferreira\">Ari da Silva Ferreira</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Kalmar_FF\" title=\"Kalmar FF\">Kalmar FF</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-resultat-2006-skytteliga&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-resultat-2006-skytteliga-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a> 5–1 <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Öster</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(27 augusti 2006)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border:none;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;background-color:transparent;color:inherit;text-align:center;\">2 matcher</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\" style=\"font-weight:normal;background-color:transparent;color:inherit;text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Öster</a> 0–4 <a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(10 april 2006)</span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Gefle_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Gefle IF Fotboll\">Gefle</a> 0–4 <a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken\" title=\"BK Häcken\">Häcken</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(17 april 2006)</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Flest mål i en match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Öster</a> 3–4 <a href=\"/wiki/IF_Elfsborg\" title=\"IF Elfsborg\">Elfsborg</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(14 april 2006)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Högsta&#160;åskådarantal</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">34&#160;174<br /><small>AIK – Djurgården, 24 april</small><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-resultat-2006-matcher&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-resultat-2006-matcher-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Lägsta&#160;åskådarantal</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">1&#160;087<br /><small>BK Häcken – Gefle IF, 1 oktober</small><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-resultat-2006-matcher&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-resultat-2006-matcher-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Åskådarantal i snitt</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">9&#160;423<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-resultat-2006-statistik-publikliga&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-resultat-2006-statistik-publikliga-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"\"><div style=\"float: left;\">&#8592; <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2005\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2005\">2005</a> </div><div style=\"float: right;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2007\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2007\">2007</a> &#8594;</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"float:right;clear:righ