/span></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 1–2 </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 3–1 </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 1–2  </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 0–3  </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 3–4 </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 1–1  </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 0–1 </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 2–1 </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> 0–0\n </span></td>\n<td style=\"background:#eee;text-align:center;color:#aaa;\">&#8212;</td> \n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Kval_till_Allsvenskan_2007\">Kval till Allsvenskan 2007</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2006&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Kval till Allsvenskan 2007\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2006&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Kval till Allsvenskan 2007\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:1.3em;background-color:#FFF;color:#000;\">\n\n\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:bold;background-color:#EFEFEF;\">\n   \n   <td style=\"min-width:18em;\"> Lag 1 </td>\n   <td style=\"min-width: 8em;cursor:help;\" title=\"Ackumulerat slutresultat\"> Totalt </td>\n   <td style=\"min-width:18em;\"> Lag 2 </td>\n   <td style=\"min-width: 7em;cursor:help;\" title=\"Lag 1 – Lag 2\"> Möte 1 </td>\n   <td style=\"min-width: 7em;cursor:help;\" title=\"Lag 2 – Lag 1\"> Möte 2 </td>\n</tr>\n\n\n<tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap;padding-right:0.6em;text-align:right;border-right:none;background-color:#CFC;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Brommapojkarna\" title=\"IF Brommapojkarna\">IF Brommapojkarna</a></td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap;text-align:center;border-left:none;border-right:none;\">4–1</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap;padding-left:0.6em;text-align:left;border-left:none;\"><a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken\" title=\"BK Häcken\">BK Häcken</a></td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap;text-align:center;cursor:help;\" title=\"Lag 1 – Lag 2\">2–0</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap;text-align:center;cursor:help;\" title=\"Lag 2 – Lag 1\">1–2</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<ul><li>2006–11–09, BP – Häcken 2–0 (BP-målskyttar: <a href=\"/wiki/Stefan_Bergtoft\" title=\"Stefan Bergtoft\">Stefan Bergtoft</a> &amp; <a href=\"/wiki/Olof_Guterstam\" title=\"Olof Guterstam\">Olof Guterstam</a>)</li>\n<li>2006–11–12, Häcken – BP 1–2 (BP-målskyttar: Olof Guterstam &amp; <a href=\"/wiki/Joakim_Runnemo\" title=\"Joakim Runnemo\">Joakim Runnemo</a>, Häcken-målskytt: <a href=\"/wiki/Daniel_Forsell\" title=\"Daniel Forsell\">Daniel Forsell</a>)<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Brommapojkarna\" title=\"IF Brommapojkarna\">IF Brommapojkarna</a> till <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2007\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2007\">Allsvenskan 2007</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Statistik\">Statistik</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2006&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Statistik\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2006&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Statistik\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editse