cite_ref-RINbeslut_9-0\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r58662249\" /><cite style=\"font-style:normal\" class=\"web\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20070926235503/http://www.rf.se/files/%7B724347A0-9A46-461B-B782-5202A4523503%7D.pdf\">”RIN:s domslut om sänkning av böter till 75 000 kronor.”</a>. Riksidrottsnämnden. Arkiverad från <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.rf.se/files/%7B724347A0-9A46-461B-B782-5202A4523503%7D.pdf\">originalet</a>&#32;den 26 september 2007<span class=\"printonly\">. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20070926235503/http://www.rf.se/files/%7B724347A0-9A46-461B-B782-5202A4523503%7D.pdf\">https://web.archive.org/web/20070926235503/http://www.rf.se/files/%7B724347A0-9A46-461B-B782-5202A4523503%7D.pdf</a></span><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">.&#32;Läst 7 augusti 2007</span>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.btitle=RIN%3As+domslut+om+s%C3%A4nkning+av+b%C3%B6ter+till+75+000+kronor.&amp;rft.atitle=&amp;rft.pub=Riksidrottsn%C3%A4mnden&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fweb.archive.org%2Fweb%2F20070926235503%2Fhttp%3A%2F%2Fwww.rf.se%2Ffiles%2F%257B724347A0-9A46-461B-B782-5202A4523503%257D.pdf&amp;rfr&#95;id=info:sid/en.wikipedia.org:Fotbollsallsvenskan&#95;2006\"><span style=\"display: none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-10\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-10\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r58662249\" /><cite style=\"font-style:normal\" class=\"news\" id=\"CITEREFPatrik&#95;Andersson\">Patrik Andersson&#32;(<a href=\"/wiki/1_september\" title=\"1 september\">1 september</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sport%C3%A5ret_2006#Fotboll\" title=\"Sportåret 200